  "headline": "Gabriel's United future remains undecided",
  "summary": "Sky Sports reports that JJ Gabriel and his family have yet to choose his next club after requesting to leave Manchester United. Barcelona, Real Madrid, Bayern Munich and Paris Saint-Germain are interested in the attacker, who turned 16 on 6 October. He remains registered with United, and no club-to-club contact has been made. His birthday could open a route to a European move, but no transfer has been agreed.",
